Z||000000||btoth||06-21-2001||01:44 PM||||Has anyone on the forum watched the movies or read the books?  It's not really much of a guy movie I know... but just wondering because it really got to me somehow.  (Don't laugh.)<P>I just got done watching the first two movies.  My dad bought them for my mom after they were on PBS this last week.<P>Well, I really enjoyed the movies and the story was excellent.  (In my opinion, of course.)  I finished watching the 2nd half of the sequel last night before going to bed.  It had a really happy ending, but for some reason I was dreaming of the stupid movie all night... barely got any sleep.  Almost like my mind was trying to figure something out and it couldn't.  And today I feel really depressed about my life... like there's something missing.  *Sigh*  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Anyone seen the movie and know what I'm talking about??<P>Thanks for the space!||||reg||9
